{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Monster is a tower defense game with Roguelite elements. You must become the commander of an army of monsters and summon monsters and defeat them to face the incoming enemies. Evolve monsters with loot earned by defeating enemies and gain items to strengthen them. Defeat the incoming enemies to the end to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed by a team of four university students from Sungkyul University in Korea. While it still has many shortcomings, we welcome your feedback as we continue improving the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050330?t=1761178528","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050330?t=1761178528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050330/624fdfcba831c8a4e45290402419732eb11ee51f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761178528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050330/624fdfcba831c8a4e45290402419732eb11ee51f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761178528","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Monster is a tower defense game with Roguelite elements. You must become the commander of an army of monsters and summon monsters and defeat them to face the incoming enemies. Evolve monsters with loot earned by defeating enemies and gain items to strengthen them. Defeat the incoming enemies to the end to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed by a team of four university students from Sungkyul University in Korea. While it still has many shortcomin